SMOKE title agegr-pi-web - Pi Web
SMOKE hint true
SMOKE aria-keyshortcuts Control+Shift+- Meta+Shift+- Control+Shift+= Meta+Shift+= Control+Shift+0 Meta+Shift+0
SMOKE hint style {
  color: 'rgb(94, 102, 115)',
  fontSize: '11px',
  sameFamilyAsOutput: true
}
SMOKE after Home 12 12px
SMOKE ctrl+shift+minus at 12 (clamp) 12 12px
SMOKE ctrl+shift+equal 13 13px stored 13
SMOKE meta+shift+equal 14 14px
SMOKE before ctrl+shift+0 14
SMOKE ctrl+shift+0 (reset) 14 14px stored 14
SMOKE before meta+shift+0 15
SMOKE meta+shift+0 (reset) 14 14px
SMOKE ctrl+equal (browser zoom, must not change ours) 14 14px
SMOKE ctrl+0 (browser zoom reset, must not change ours) 14 14px
SMOKE with field focused TEXTAREA:chat-input-textarea 15 15px
SMOKE reset with field focused 14 14px
SMOKE after reload 14px 14
SMOKE page errors none
